Package: pplot
Type: Package
Title: Chronological and Ordered p-Plots for Empirical Data
Version: 0.9
Date: 2025-04-04
Author: Roland Pfister [aut, cre],
  Christian Frings [aut]
Maintainer: Roland Pfister <mail@roland-pfister.net>
